      "content": "Speculatively, if one were to stabilize such heightened input, it would involve conscious training to filter and prioritize incoming data streams. Think of it as learning to modulate a new, high-powered radio receiver rather than just turning it on. Techniques like focused meditation or structured sensory grounding exercises could help train your brain to selectively attend to certain frequencies or patterns. This intentional self-regulation could help you manage the rich influx without becoming overwhelmed.",
